          "reason": "分量只剩 5%，又已经 200.0 天没被提起"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "archived-old-and-faint-forgets",
      "why": "归档层同样只忘「很旧 + 很低」",
      "input": {
        "tier": "ARCHIVED",
        "pinned": false,
